sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Roommate (browser)
    participant API as ApiHandler
    participant P as PeriodService
    participant D as DisputeService
    participant R as ReportService
    participant F as Files (data/, reports/)
    U->>API: POST /api/period/2026-10/finalize
    API->>P: finalizeMonth(2026-10)
    P->>D: unresolvedFor(2026-10)
    alt open disputes exist
        D-->>P: [D2]
        P-->>API: throw UnresolvedDisputeException
        API-->>U: 409 "1 dispute(s) still unresolved [D2]"
    else all disputes closed
        D-->>P: []
        P->>F: write finalized_months.txt, audit.log
        API->>R: export(2026-10)
        R->>F: settlement_2026-10.txt / .csv
        API-->>U: 200 "Month finalised and report saved"
    end
